  "body": "OffscreenCanvas.ConvertToBlob is modifed so as to be consistent with\nthe spec of canvas.toBlob. In particular, when the canvas element's\nbitmap has no pixels, the function should not throw an exception;\ninstead, it should let the result blob be null. It's similar for the case when\nthe image encoding is not successful.\n\nThe corresponding web-platform-tests changes are here:\nhttps://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/8833\n@junov @fserb\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3336/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 9, 2018, 8:36 PM GMT (47f8926)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3336/99e2cdf...47f8926/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 9, 2018, 8:36 PM GMT (47f8926)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3336/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 9, 2018, 8:36 PM GMT (47f8926)\">/canvas.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3336/99e2cdf...47f8926/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 9, 2018, 8:36 PM GMT (47f8926)\">diff</a> )",
